BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DINO FEST at ECHO
DTSTART:20260812T100000
DTEND:20260812T150000
DTSTAMP:20260809T173321Z
UID:1f9784629b30273c71b9cc531a73f7@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Roar into a day packed with all things dinosaurs! Discover how
  these incredible creatures may have lived\, from their daily habits to th
 e asteroid impact that changed life on Earth forever. Meet the survivors: 
 come face-to-face with local species whose ancestors lived alongside the d
 inosaurs — and made it through the extinction event that their dino rela
 tives didn’t. From snapping turtles to sturgeon\, you’ll be surprised 
 who’s still around today.<br/><br/>Don’t forget to explore our Dinosau
 r Safari exhibit before ending your day with some awesome gift shop dino m
 erch!\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Kids & Family
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/dino-fest-
 at-echo-29-07-2026-16-24-44
END:VEVENT
